# Build output and installed dependencies.
#
# This repo had no .gitignore until 2026-08-13. `npm install` steps in
# docs/operator-quickstart.md leave untracked trees behind, and without this
# file a later `git add -A` would commit installed packages plus build output.
#
# The frontend was SvelteKit (`appview/games-mcp-component/svelte/`) through
# 2026-09-07; it is now the cljs+reagent+re-frame appview at
# `appview/games-mcp-component/cljs/` (ADR-2608260900). `.svelte-kit/` is gone
# with it; `cljs/` has its own nested `.gitignore` for `.shadow-cljs/`,
# `out/`, and `public/js/`.

node_modules/
.wrangler/
dist/
build/
